REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : TCDB WAS BUILT USING THE PUBLISHED 3.87          
REMARK   3  ANGSTROM CRYSTAL STRUCTURE AS A STARTING MODEL (PDB: 6OQ5). THE     
REMARK   3  THREE BOUND VHH DOMAINS IN THE CRYSTAL STRUCTURE WERE REMOVED IN    
REMARK   3  PYMOL, AND THE STRUCTURE WAS DOCKED INTO DENSITY USING CHIMERA.     
REMARK   3  THE INITIAL MODEL WAS REFINED IN COOT BEFORE ALIGNMENT WITH THE     
REMARK   3  DESIGN MODEL IN PYMOL, THE SCFV DOCKED WELL IN DENSITY. THE         
REMARK   3  ENTIRE MODEL WAS REFINED WITH ITERATIVE ROUNDS IN COOT,             
REMARK   3  INTERACTIVE STRUCTURE OPTIMIZATION BY LOCAL DIRECT EXPLORATION      
REMARK   3  (ISOLDE) WERE PERFORMED AT A SIMULATED 25 KELVIN, AND PHENIX        
REMARK   3  REAL-SPACE REFINEMENT. THE FINAL MODEL QUALITY WAS ANALYZED         
REMARK   3  USING MOLPROBITY.                                                   
